data: {"id": "9e7471bbf66b4771-thinking-parallel_evidence-1032", "run_id": "9e7471bbf66b4771", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "首轮采集结果已返回，但存在关键冲突和缺口：**Metrics 显示 Last terminated reason=OOMKilled**，但 **Logs 和 Tracing 均为空/正常**。这表明：\n1. **OOMKilled 证据不足**：Logs 没有 `OOMKilled`、`out of memory` 等关键词；Tracing 也没有相关异常。需要补证。\n2. **日志时序偏差**：Logs 显示的是正常运行时的 `memory allocation advanced` 日志，没有崩溃前日志。需要查 previous logs。\n3. **Pod 拓扑和 Events 缺失**：首轮中 Topology 和 `kubectl_describe` 尚未执行，需要补充。\n\n执行补证计划：\n1. `kubectl_describe`：确认 Pod 状态、重启次数、Last State、Events。\n2. `kubectl_previous_logs`：查上一次崩溃前的日志。\n3. `kubectl_events`：查最近的事件。\n4. `query_pod_topology", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789082198916, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

